                  "presentation": "key_point",
                  "position": 1,
                  "text": "Biological hazards include bacteria, viruses, fungi, parasites, and spores; the current curriculum uses Salmonella from raw poultry as an example.",
                  "provenance_classification": "existing_training_supporting"
                },
                {
                  "fact_key": "chemical-hazards",
                  "presentation": "key_point",
                  "position": 2,
                  "text": "Chemical hazards include pesticide residue, cleaning chemicals, rust, and incorrectly stored chemicals.",
